Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.04,0:00:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Because, you're going to be\Njoining me on my mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.52,0:00:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, I'm planning to beat your boss\Nand take back this city for the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.96,0:00:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.88,0:00:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,To rid this city of drug dealing\Nand child abusing mafiosi,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.42,0:00:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no other choice but\Nto become a mafioso myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.96,0:00:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.52,0:00:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely your mission doesn't\Ninvolve joining our Syndicate?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.40,0:00:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea what you're saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.02,0:00:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What something like that would entail?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.48,0:00:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.64,0:00:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.58,0:00:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,it's risky, but to take back the city,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.94,0:00:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to join the syndicate that\Ncontrols it and work my way to the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.66,0:00:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati, trust me,\NI'll be a primo mafioso.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.44,0:00:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm open, pass it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.52,0:00:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy mille!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.06,0:00:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.97,0:01:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll report I was unable\Nto locate Luka's attacker.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.12,0:01:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll introduce you to\Nbegin the initiation process.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.52,0:01:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But you should know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.96,0:01:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,if it ever gets out that you're\Nattempting to take down the boss,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.00,0:01:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be forced to cut ties with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.24,0:01:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,A traitor stands alone on\Nan island of isolation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.74,0:01:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Your failure will be\Nyours and yours alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.04,0:01:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing certain yet, but\Nyour resolve is undeniable.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.24,0:01:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I respect that kind of nobility, and\NI commend your golden aspirations.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.90,0:01:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You have my support.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.70,0:02:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.38,0:02:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We will continue to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.74,0:02:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We will fight with our enemies!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.38,0:03:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.38,0:03:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's not the boss's actual name.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.56,0:03:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,To be frank, no one knows his true name,\Nnor does anyone know what he looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.68,0:03:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Orders are passed down\Nvia a multitude of kapos.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.16,0:03:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno, the Cape who will decide your\Nfuture in the Family is a man named Polpo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.76,0:03:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.80,0:03:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He resides here in this building.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.80,0:03:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.60,0:03:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.44,0:03:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.50,0:03:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Polpo was convicted and promptly\Nsentenced to 15 years in prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.38,0:03:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He still issues orders\Nand manages the Family,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.76,0:03:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,but he does it all from\Nwithin those walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.10,0:04:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He can leave his confinement whenever the\Ndesire strikes him, but he chooses not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.76,0:04:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He simply has no need.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.26,0:04:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,¿Por qué?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.18,0:04:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Your answer's inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.00,0:04:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Giorno.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.26,0:04:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,In a matter of minutes,\Nhe'll conduct your interview.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.98,0:04:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's imperative you pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.68,0:04:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no different from\Nan ordinary interview.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.22,0:04:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,His mood will dictate its content.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.02,0:04:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And remember, he cannot find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.90,0:04:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.00,0:04:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Before I forget, you mentioned\Nour powers are called stands, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.94,0:04:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I never asked, how did you acquire yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.38,0:04:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And do others have them?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.20,0:04:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Once again, the answer's waiting inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.82,0:04:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If you pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.38,0:04:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Before you head in,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.76,0:04:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to need your watch and\Neverything in your pockets on this tray.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.36,0:04:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, you can\Nmove on to the pat-down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.14,0:05:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stand over there,\Nhands above your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.56,0:05:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we open the gate, proceed forward,\Nthen stop at the end of the hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.32,0:05:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.06,0:05:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Polpo's cell is labeled N-28.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.20,0:05:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't miss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.48,0:05:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Reinforced glass keeps him inside,\Nbut you can still converse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.04,0:05:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep in mind, exchanging objects either\Nfrom him or yourself is strictly forbidden,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.96,0:05:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,so don't try anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.24,0:05:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You only have 15 minutes\Nto complete your visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.80,0:05:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you enter, I'll\Nclose the gate behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.82,0:05:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If he gets hostile, just\Nyell and we'll assist you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.60,0:05:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm talking to him while\Nhe's locked up in his cell?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.26,0:05:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not going to get a special room?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.08,0:05:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.22,0:05:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you realize who he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.80,0:06:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's injured, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.50,0:06:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Your left arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.32,0:06:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.23,0:06:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought that was a bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.22,0:06:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I spy a faint yet distinct\Nred marking on the fingers of
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.68,0:06:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,your right hand that signifies\Nyou were gripping something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.98,0:06:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say they're the markings\Nleft behind by a bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.90,0:06:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And based on that fact, you've been carrying\Nthe bag exclusively in your right hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.62,0:06:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Now why would that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.90,0:06:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, first of all, you're correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.72,0:06:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I carried my bag with my right hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.20,0:06:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, I did injure my left arm earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.70,0:07:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I envy your youthful\Nbody and reckless spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.64,0:07:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,By the by, do you drink wine?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.04,0:07:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This Chianti Classico is molto Bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.14,0:07:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And when paired with a few crackers,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.16,0:07:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,scamorza and the right amount\Nof caviar, It's perfection.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.10,0:07:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not allowed to give you anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.22,0:07:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And I can't accept\Nanything from you either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.10,0:07:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just a silly formality.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.42,0:07:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What people say when watched and what\Nthey do when no one else is around
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.00,0:07:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,are two entirely different things.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.24,0:07:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Therein lies the beauty and ugliness\Nof this fickle thing we call humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.92,0:07:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose the only real tragedy to\Nbeing holed up in this cell is...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.42,0:07:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Polpo,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.04,0:07:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,he's living like a king, but that's\Nnot the reason he stays put in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.44,0:07:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't matter if he left or stayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.54,0:07:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And let's be honest, with that\Ncarcass, he's probably safer in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.40,0:08:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The thing I want to\Nknow is how the hell the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.58,0:08:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,guards even managed to\Nfit in through the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.56,0:08:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati's already\Ntold me all about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.46,0:08:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So you desire to be a part\Nof our Family, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.42,0:08:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, it was Giorno Giovanna, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.00,0:08:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, if you're ready to begin,\Nlet's say we commence with the interview.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.00,0:08:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.50,0:08:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I hallucinating?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.46,0:08:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,For a second, it looked like he\Nwas munching away on his fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.18,0:08:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe this cazzone\Npolpo is simply another
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.04,0:08:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,one of those stand users like Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.24,0:08:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, I have to do whatever it takes\Nto keep him from finding out about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.06,0:09:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,When you're separating\Nthe wheat from the chaff,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.74,0:09:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,what do you think is the most\Nimportant factor for one to consider?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.22,0:09:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Think carefully, Giovanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.88,0:09:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What a person can do, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.12,0:09:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, then what can you do, ragazzo?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.12,0:09:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,While that guard was patting\Nme down, I took some souvenirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.38,0:09:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought they might come\Nin handy during our test.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.50,0:09:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, I'll return them on my way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.84,0:09:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that all you brought to impress me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.20,0:09:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, besides that, I have this\Nother little trick I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.36,0:09:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I can fold my ear into my ear canal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.76,0:09:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, molto interessante.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.48,0:09:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But you see, there's something very\Nimportant we haven't discussed yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.40,0:09:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And that is the delicate subject\Nof trust, Giorno Giovanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.78,0:10:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the most important quality\Nin selecting an associate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.46,0:10:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They must be trustworthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.84,0:10:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,When compared to that\Nessential characteristic,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.08,0:10:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,intelligence and talent are\Nno more significant than
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.70,0:10:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,this piece of slobbery cracker\Nstuck between my teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.08,0:10:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,My test will tell me exactly\Nhow trustworthy you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.46,0:10:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The discerning flame of\Nthis lighter reveals all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.54,0:10:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now take it in hand and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.90,0:10:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You are not to let the flame expire.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.64,0:10:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Aspetta, I warn you,\Nexercise extreme caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.12,0:10:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The 17th century theologian\NFuller once said,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.74,0:10:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He's my friend that speaks\Nwell of me behind my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.16,0:10:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd do well to remember those words.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.48,0:10:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to become part of our Family,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.26,0:10:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll need to demonstrate your\Ntrustworthiness even when no one's looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.58,0:10:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,24 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.20,0:10:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how long you'll\Npossess the lighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.46,0:10:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You must never let the flame go out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.98,0:11:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If you pass this test,\Nyou'll be welcome to join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.38,0:11:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Straightforward, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.58,0:11:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't worry, there's\Nplenty of flu in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.78,0:11:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,All that's required to pass is for\Nyou to sit in your room until 3 p .m.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.20,0:11:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,tomorrow looking after that flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.30,0:11:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you're truly a man\Nof prudence and perseverance,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.68,0:11:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,then nothing should happen to that light.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.78,0:11:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Do this simple task and you will\Nhave proven your trustworthiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.56,0:11:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't get too complacent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.72,0:11:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If you happen to be the kind of person\Nwho would take what I have to say lightly,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.78,0:11:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,let's say you nod off, or you\Nsneeze, or maybe you stumble,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.78,0:11:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,or perhaps a gust of wind\Nextinguishes that precious flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.04,0:11:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll know beyond a shadow\Nof a doubt that you,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.84,0:11:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,my friend, cannot be trusted\Nas a member of our Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.56,0:11:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now take the lighter and\Nbe on your way, Cucholo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.74,0:11:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold the key to our Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.06,0:12:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You have 24 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.80,0:12:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I look forward to our\Nsecond meeting tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.14,0:12:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,3 p .m.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.66,0:12:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.96,0:12:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,24 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.82,0:12:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,All visitors must proceed through\Nthe gate for a final pat-down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.74,0:12:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,once we give you permission\Nto exit the premises
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.26,0:12:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,you may proceed to the\Nnext room to retrieve
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.88,0:12:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,your belongings wait a second didn't Polpo
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.10,0:12:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,say anything to you time\Nfor your search you've
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.08,0:12:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,been warned accepting\Nanything from a convict
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.22,0:12:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,is punishable by law.\NMerida, I was banking on the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.22,0:12:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,fact that he would have\Nbribed these cops to let
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.84,0:12:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,me walk out of here with\Nthe lighter scot-free
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.52,0:12:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Atencione!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.43,0:12:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands above your head\Nand step forward now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.70,0:12:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.61,0:12:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Polpo's test has already started.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.60,0:12:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means there's no turning back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.56,0:12:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.86,0:12:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to become a part of the\NPassione Family at any cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.24,0:13:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Step forward, nice and slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.62,0:13:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I concealed her ID in the palm of my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.06,0:13:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I can hide this flame too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.56,0:13:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.16,0:13:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.70,0:13:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't seem to be anything out of order.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.02,0:13:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're free to leave the premises.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.04,0:13:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, I ask that\Nyou show me your palms.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.20,0:13:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll say it once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.16,0:13:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're prohibited from accepting\Nany objects from convicts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.70,0:14:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Now open your hands immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.86,0:14:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's an order!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.90,0:14:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,A flower?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.28,0:14:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.48,0:14:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This thing is an actual flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.96,0:14:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.87,0:14:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If this is the worst you've\Ngot, you can have it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.84,0:14:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Our visitor is free to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.98,0:14:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I transformed the lighter into a flower\Nand hid the flame within the petals.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.96,0:14:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, that was too close for comfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.86,0:14:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it, could this\Nflame actually be part of Polpo's stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.04,0:15:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This wind is a major problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.76,0:15:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, Giorno! Perfect timing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.36,0:15:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, could you be a pal and\Npress the shutter button?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.96,0:15:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope, not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.42,0:15:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, youngster, but would you\Nmind lending me a hand with all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.56,0:15:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.38,0:15:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally made it back to the dorm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.94,0:15:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.56,0:15:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.94,0:15:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This should keep it upright.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.48,0:15:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And even if there's a little draft, it\Nshouldn't be enough to blow out the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.46,0:15:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, as Polpo said,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.26,0:15:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,all I have to do is\Nremain diligent and watch
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.42,0:15:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,this flame with my life for 23 more hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.86,0:15:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right. The window.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.98,0:16:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to make sure it's good and locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.76,0:16:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You never really know when a gust\Nof wind might suddenly strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.80,0:16:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.71,0:16:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would just go and open my door?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.48,0:16:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.14,0:16:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I guess he hasn't come home yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.56,0:16:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's now or never.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.72,0:16:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that the Japanese tourist?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.52,0:16:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's Koichi Hirose.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.40,0:16:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell did the guy\Nfind out where I live?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.32,0:16:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.23,0:16:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have already done something\Nwith my suitcase and everything inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.56,0:16:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Although, he may have left my\Npassport around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.66,0:16:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Selling off a personal ID?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.78,0:16:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That process has got to\Nbe a lot more involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.38,0:16:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I'm\Nsneaking around his room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.82,0:16:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like a common thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.88,0:16:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what am I saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.14,0:16:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.10,0:16:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,All I'm doing is looking\Nfor what's rightfully mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.78,0:16:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.69,0:16:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,His passport! Katsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.44,0:17:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's in the box on my desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.12,0:17:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I was gonna give it back to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.76,0:17:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time\Nbefore Koichi finds that flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.60,0:17:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no question he'll\Nput it out once he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.34,0:17:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll just think it's a fire hazard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.04,0:17:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it. Think.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.74,0:17:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to somehow get that\Nlighter back before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.68,0:17:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Golden wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.58,0:17:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.80,0:17:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Golden Wind managed to turn\Nthat lamp cord into a snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.08,0:17:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a feeling you'd like that bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.32,0:17:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice job digging in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.56,0:17:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now to reel it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.06,0:17:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What the? Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.66,0:17:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.16,0:17:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He still found the lighter?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.28,0:17:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's going to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.98,0:17:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I just need to make sure\Nhe doesn't blow it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.16,0:17:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.76,0:18:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.24,0:18:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the Imperial\NSeal of Japan! Found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.68,0:18:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I got my passport back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.66,0:18:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.57,0:18:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But I didn't mean to set it on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.30,0:18:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.18,0:18:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.09,0:18:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's weird. Where'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.22,0:18:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I saw a lit lighter here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.94,0:18:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Another close call.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.94,0:18:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That tourist guy almost put\Nout the flame accidentally.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.88,0:18:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,but nobody's gonna extinguish my dream and\Nthe first step to realizing my goal is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.26,0:18:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,protecting this flimsy flame with my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.58,0:18:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,just missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.22,0:18:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,there you're sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.14,0:18:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,about that was cleaning the\Nstairs and got carried away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.16,0:18:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.07,0:18:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,glad you were able to dodge that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.54,0:18:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,i almost gave you an unwanted shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.38,0:18:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,i suppose we both done our\Nfair share of good deeds today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.98,0:18:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,wouldn't you say so?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.04,0:19:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,sunny living each day as the good\Nlord intended is very important.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.22,0:19:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,are you shitting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.16,0:19:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,i don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.72,0:19:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,the flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.02,0:19:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,maybe if i go back and grovel Polpo\Nwill let me start the test over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.82,0:19:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,no i can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.00,0:19:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,if he were that forgiving he wouldn't be
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.98,0:19:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,putting me through this\Ntest in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.80,0:19:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,something wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.66,0:19:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,my what? What do we have here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.88,0:19:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Is your lighter not working for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.74,0:19:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's some bad luck there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.12,0:19:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I didn't break it, did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.72,0:19:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but this doesn't concern you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.04,0:19:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just trying to figure out\Nwhat my next move should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.82,0:19:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,From the looks of it, it might\Nstill be in working order.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.48,0:19:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The lighter itself looks fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.18,0:19:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And if I'm not mistaken, I think I hear\Nthe sucker releasing its fuel. Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.32,0:19:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.74,0:19:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.14,0:19:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something coming out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.64,0:19:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be how you switch\Nit on like this. You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.38,0:20:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's impossible Why would\Nyou be able to turn it back on?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.76,0:20:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The thing is either on or it's\Nnot That's the point of the test
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.26,0:20:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,if I could reignite it whenever I\Nwanted the test would be futile.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.20,0:20:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Granted that was more of blowtorch than a
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.56,0:20:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,lighter but I think I\Ngot it working again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.04,0:20:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So score one for persistence\Nsee? See? Gotta say,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.22,0:20:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,it's kind of strange\Nyou're carrying a lighter
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.24,0:20:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,when you don't seem to\Nbe much of a smoker,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.54,0:20:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,but to each his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.62,0:20:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.53,0:20:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd it reignite?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.74,0:20:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Something has to be wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.38,0:20:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell did I just see?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.30,0:20:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That couldn't be a stand, could it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.10,0:20:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who reignited the flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.60,0:20:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I offer two paths, but you must pick\Nthe one that will lead to salvation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.52,0:20:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, I was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.92,0:20:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.44,0:20:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you live on and\Nbecome one of the chosen,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.32,0:20:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,or do you proceed along the path of death?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.96,0:21:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.32,0:21:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And not just any stand, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.38,0:21:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's got to be Polpo's.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.16,0:21:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who reignited the flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.72,0:21:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You shall receive my arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.78,0:21:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's too far, Bastardo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.54,0:21:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You've messed with the wrong guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.98,0:21:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.89,0:21:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not the one!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.36,0:21:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This soul does not belong to the chosen!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.10,0:21:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.80,0:21:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, old man! Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.40,0:21:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There's not a single wound on him!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.12,0:21:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.80,0:21:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The arrow didn't pierce him\Nphysically, it pierced his soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.62,0:21:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So he rips a person's\Nsoul from their body and
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.06,0:21:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,ends their life with a\Npierce from the arrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.46,0:21:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that how he does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.44,0:21:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He said something about the soul\Nof the Chosen receiving the arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.00,0:21:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that what they call\Nsomeone who joins the Family?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.40,0:21:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You two have reignited the flame!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.26,0:22:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Salvation awaits!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.90,0:22:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare, as before you light two paths!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.80,0:22:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time I close my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.82,0:22:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up feeling so horny!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.02,0:22:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get you out of my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.96,0:22:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you'll be all I see?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.44,0:22:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I would give anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.50,0:22:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Just to make you understand me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.60,0:22:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't give a damn about nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.92,0:22:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Freaking you is all I need!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.42,0:22:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight I need your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.40,0:22:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I need your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.14,0:22:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight you got my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.32,0:22:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.20,0:22:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight you won't decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.80,0:23:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight you got my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.94,0:23:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If you've got my mind, all\NI want to do is free you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.80,0:23:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.44,0:23:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.24,0:23:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.84,0:23:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.82,0:23:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,To show how much I'm going to free you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.12,0:23:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.84,0:23:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.68,0:23:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.59,0:23:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,To show how much I'm going to free you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.94,0:23:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm freaking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.40,0:24:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
